<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt"><B><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">WVE-007</FONT> </B>is an investigational GalNAc-siRNA (SpiNA) designed to
induce fat loss without muscle loss. With strong evidence from human genetics, silencing INHBE mRNA is a promising therapeutic strategy to treat obesity, distinct from incretin-based approaches. <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">WVE-007</FONT> is
being evaluated in the ongoing placebo-controlled INLIGHT clinical trial. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
